*
* Definition of directions is based on observer at beach with face to the sea (=shore normal)
* Incidence wave angles are defined with respect to shore normal
* Waves coming from left of shore normal have a positive angle to shore normal
* Longshore current coming from left of shore normal has a positive value
* Waves coming from right of shore normal have a negative angle to shore normal
* Longshore current coming from right of shore normal has a negative value
* X-axis starts offshore;x=0 at offshore boundary; positive in landward direction
